n opponent holding just an Ace, the risk that they have hit a flush or straight is significant enough to warrant caution. Since I am leading the game in cumulative chips, there is no need to bloat the pot and risk a large loss or face a raise. Checking allows me to realize the showdown value of my hand cheaply.\nAnswer: 0'}
