ctively realizing your equity with zero risk. Given you are leading the match cumulatively, avoiding unnecessary variance in marginal spots is strategically sound.\n\nReason: You have a drawing hand with low current value. Checking allows you to see a free turn card to try and hit your straight or improve your draw without risking chips.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
